  "transcript": "Vercel just shipped a free, official skill called find-skills that searches the public Claude Code skills directory and installs the best one for you in one command. But that viral \"700,000 pre-vetted skills\" claim is wrong, and blindly installing skills is a real security risk. This is how to find any Claude skill you need fast AND install only the ones that are actually safe, with a 4-point trust check and free skill scanners. Covers the npx skills CLI, skills.sh, vetting by install count and GitHub stars, and reading the SKILL.md before you install. #Shorts #claudecode #claudeskills\n\nGet the trusted-skills guide here: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Ei1zff7KArDJqD_g7T4hIttm50e1OG4AOBhegmIKvtA/edit?usp=sharing",
